OL,3,GNEWSADrugs dug up at Creamfields site
OL,4,Aahead of festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuge stashes of illegal drugs have been
OL,7,Ffound buried underground at a festival
OL,8,Fsite days before the event was due to
OL,9,Fbegin.
OL,11,FMore than 80,000 music fans will head
OL,12,Fto Creamfields Festival in Daresbury,
OL,13,FCheshire, from Thursday.
OL,15,FAbout 204 canisters of nitrous oxide -
OL,16,Fknown as laughing gas - and large bags
OL,17,Fcontaining ecstasy, MDMA and ketamine
OL,18,Ftablets were dug up by police during a
OL,19,Fpre-event search of the grounds,
OL,20,FCheshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
